      "t": "Taking Viktor Petrovich's advice to heart, mild-mannered Lyova suddenly explodes at the staff, barking at Vika to stay out of kitchen affairs and stripping the cooks of their bonuses. Stunned by his ferocious outburst, Senya, Fedya, and the rest of the crew immediately snap to attention.",
